# Heavy / ODbL / synthetic artifacts that should NOT ship to Vercel.
# NOTE: this is an explicit DENYLIST, anything under data/ NOT listed below DOES
# ship. data/core_verified.json, data/routes.json, and data/route-overrides.json
# are intentionally kept (not listed) because scripts/prepare-core-pack.mjs and
# scripts/build-core-pack-beta.mjs read them at deploy time to build the
# field-verified CorePack (route-overrides.json corrects OSM route fields such as
# mate shouts). Do NOT add those three here.
data/osm_raw/
data/osm_import.sql
data/promote_to_core.sql
data/osm_treasure_map.html
data/osm_treasure_map.json
data/sample-fieldwork-export.json
data/sample-admin-verification.json
data/sample-admin-v2.json
data/sample-routes.json
data/sample-core_verified.json
data/route-changes-review.json
# The sellable, OSM-free verified pack (build:pack:beta output), never ship publicly.
data/core-pack-verified.json
